{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object detected, move, take, process it. Else, scan for safe area, inspect object.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ScanForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsAreaSafe    /> <Action ID = MoveToSafeArea    /> <Action ID = InspectObject    />",
